---
description: Compose Multiplatform UI and ViewModels in app/shared
globs: app/shared/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared UI (`:app:shared`)

- MVVM: `*UiState` + `StateFlow`, events into ViewModel; repositories hide Ktor/SQL details.
- Koin: modules in `commonMain`; `koinViewModel()` / injected constructors — never resolve dependencies inside `@Composable` without Koin API.
- Prefer `collectAsStateWithLifecycle()` on Android; use lifecycle-compose on other targets when available.
- Navigation and one-off effects belong in ViewModel/callbacks, not random `LaunchedEffect` chains.
- Reuse `:core` models; do not duplicate DTOs in UI packages.
- File-level constants and small helpers immediately after imports (Weel-style).
- Tests: `commonTest` / `jvmTest` for ViewModels and repository fakes before Robolectric/device UI.
